# bench_extreme_poly: the 7.1 matrix with 7.2's separable stages
# `stage breakdown` is the library's own per-stage timing inside
#   MeshSculptor::stamp (mesh::StageTelemetry). No clock is read when the
#   telemetry pointer is null, which is what let 7.2's remaining stages be
#   timed without perturbing a stamp outside this program.
# spacing 0.0100, 20 repetitions per cell after 4 warm-up stamps
